window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It's just another Monster Monday . . .</p> <p>Billy expected many things to happen—but getting into an elevator with the omega he's been stalking and seeing an invisible tentacle monster for the first time wasn't one of them.</p> <p>Charlie is an invisible tentacle monster who never believed he could be seen or loved. Jaehan is an omega witch who recently escaped a bad situation and is just trying to settle into his new job.</p> <p>After meeting in the elevator, passions arise, and souls connect. When Billy and their boss are kidnapped, the Warts &amp; Claws office will have to pull together and fight against the monster trying to ruin their lives.</p> <p>Can Billy, Jaehan, and Charlie live to see another Monday without sacrificing what they have found?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
